Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.57,0:02:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是床垫大王{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ew, ew! It's the Mattress King.{\r}
