Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.20,0:02:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}等等  我想看  我跟他离婚后…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wait. I want to see this. After I divorce him...{\r}
