Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.38,0:02:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我决定将价格…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...I'm going to slash...{\r}
