Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}加州特大床垫599元  舒适层加大床垫499元{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}599 for a California king. 499 for a pillow-top queen set.{\r}
