Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}真是低贱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What a wank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我无法相信他他居然拿我们的离婚  来卖床垫{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, I cannot believe he's using our divorce to sell mattresses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}就是啊  舒适层加大床垫499元  谁还管离婚啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I know. At 499 for a pillow-top queen, who cares about the divorce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}它们一定卖得出去{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Those babies will sell themselves.{\r}
