Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}"We"? Ahem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}明天要跟我爸吃晚饭  没问题吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Are, uh, having dinner with my dad tomorrow night. I hope that's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}糟糕  明天不方便{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, shoot. Tomorrow's not good.{\r}
