Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.39,0:03:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}掉在一个没有坐垫的  脚踏车上面…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and land on a bicycle with no seat, so...{\r}
