Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}听着  就一顿饭  为了我就一晚  好吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, look, I know. Just one dinner. Please, one night. For me. Please?{\r}
