Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  也许不能像我一样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right. Well, not exactly like I do.{\r}
