Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我愿意去{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'll go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.14,0:04:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  谢谢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Fine. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你好  阿甘{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hi, Gunther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.81,0:04:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是啊  再说吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah. We'll see.{\r}
