Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.65,0:04:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿  你们猜怎么着{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey. Hey.  Guess what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我有工作了  太好了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I got a gig. Great.{\r}
