Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.91,0:04:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对啊  我也说不出"可颂" 天哪{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, I can't say "croissant." Oh, my God.{\r}
