Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.29,0:04:32.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}太棒了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Come on. That's great.{\r}
